!logs/*.pgn
tools/nnue/data/
tools/nnue/checkpoints/
tools/book/cache/
# Weight files are never committed from a feature branch. `harness/package.py` has
# `DEFAULT_INCLUDES = ("weights",)`, so anything sitting here is packaged into submission.zip,
# and a smoke net left behind would ship instead of the real one. The net that ships arrives
# by its own PR from the machine that trained it, and only that PR removes this line.
# `weights/book.bin` is committed on `prod` and is not matched by this.
weights/*.npz
